{"ld": 2077, "paper": "HP1392", "session": "132", "title": "An Act to Reduce the Cost of Purchasing a Home by Providing Grants to Reduce Mortgage Rates", "sponsor_id": "h-farrin-wayne", "cosponsor_ids": ["h-eaton-holly", "h-fecteau-ryan", "h-frost-sharon", "h-golek-cheryl", "h-terry-parnell", "h-webb-kilton"], "committee_code": "HED", "committee_name": "Housing and Economic Development", "summary": {"text": "This bill:\n\n1. Requires the Maine State Housing Authority to administer a program to provide grants of up to $15,000 to persons with low income and moderate income for the purpose of decreasing the rate of a mortgage loan used to purchase an owner-occupied single-family residence. Current law allows the authority to refinance existing loans for the purpose of lowering mortgage payments or making home improvements for persons with low income; and 2. Allows a taxpayer an income tax deduction for payments made to purchase private mortgage insurance for that taxpayer's primary residence located in Maine.", "official": true, "source": "Bill text, https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=HP1392&item=1&snum=132"}, "status": "died", "status_label": "Died On Adjournment", "final_disposition": {"label": "Died On Adjournment", "date": "2026-04-29", "governor_action": null, "governor_action_date": null}, "fiscal_status": "Not Yet Determined", "documents": [{"label": "Bill text (LD 2077)", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=HP1392&item=1&snum=132", "item": 1}, {"label": "Amendment C-A (H-935)", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=HP1392&item=2&snum=132", "item": 2}], "amendments": [{"id": "C-A (H-935)", "description": null, "sponsor": null, "status": "Adopted by House & Senate", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=HP1392&item=2&snum=132", "fiscal_note_url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/bills_132nd/fiscalpdfs/FN207702.pdf"}], "committee_actions": [{"